---
import clsx from 'clsx';
import NavV2 from '@src/components/NavV2.astro';
import MediaCard from '@src/components/MediaCard';
import Seo from '@src/components/Seo';
import HtmlLayout from '@src/layouts/Html.astro';
import BodyLayout from '@src/layouts/Body.astro';
import HeadLayout from '@src/layouts/Head.astro';
import Footer from '@src/components/Footer';

const shots = [
  {
    src: '/img/hero/warsaw.jpeg',
    alt: 'Shivek in Warsaw',
    title: 'Warsaw',
    type: 'image' as const,
  },
  {
    src: '/img/hero/porto.jpeg',
    alt: 'Walking in Porto garden',
    title: 'Porto',
    type: 'image' as const,
  },
  {
    src: '/img/hero/dubai.jpeg',
    alt: 'Dubai',
    title: 'Dubai',
    type: 'image' as const,
  },
  {
    src: '/video/clothing.mp4',
    alt: 'Fashion Talk in Warsaw',
    title: 'Fashion Talk',
    type: 'video' as const,
  },
];
---

<HtmlLayout>
  <HeadLayout>
    <Seo
      title="About"
      subTitle="Moments from my journey"
      heroImg="/img/og.png"
      authorName="Shivek Khurana"
    />
  </HeadLayout>

  <BodyLayout>
    <NavV2 />
    <main class={clsx('w-11/12 mx-auto lg:w-10/12 xl:w-8/12', 'mt-16 mb-24')}>
      <section class="font-mlm-roman">
        <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold font-mlm-roman mb-8">About</h1>

        <!-- About Me Content -->
        <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none mb-16">
          <section class="mb-12">
            <p class="mb-6 leading-relaxed">
              Shivek is a product engineer, entrepreneur, writer, and investor.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-6 leading-relaxed">
              He has shipped products used by millions, led teams, built
              revenue-generating systems, and advised companies on product and
              growth.
            </p>
          </section>

          <!-- Media cards grid -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 md:gap-6 mb-16">
            {
              shots.map((shot, index) => (
                <MediaCard
                  src={shot.src}
                  alt={shot.alt}
                  title={shot.title}
                  type={shot.type}
                  loading={index === 0 ? 'eager' : 'lazy'}
                  fetchPriority={index === 0 ? 'high' : undefined}
                />
              ))
            }
          </div>

          <section class="mb-12">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-xl md:text-2xl mb-6">Background</h3>

            <p class="mb-6 leading-relaxed">
              His story started in 2006, where he gained access to internet for
              the first time. Writing code in html felt like magic. But due to
              lack of access to computers, and broadband internet he had to wait
              until 2009 to start coding seriously. He started writing Bash and
              C++, learning from books and practicing in the limited computer
              time available.
            </p>

            <section class="">
              <h3 class="font-bold text-xl md:text-2xl mb-6">Growth</h3>

              <p class="mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                In 2013, he started volunteering at a local NGO, helping with
                the website and other tasks. In this process he was introduced
                to CodeIgniter, Laravel and the PHP community. He also started
                pursing his Bachelor's degree in Mathematics and Information
                Technology from the University of Delhi.
              </p>

              <p class="mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                During his tenure at the university, he worked with multiple
                startups and got exposed to the world of entrepreneurship. He
                tried his hand at multiple startups, none of which were
                successful.
              </p>

              <p class="mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                After graduating, he picked up Clojure and ClojureScript, and
                became a full time consultant. Working with telecommunication
                and insurance companies.
              </p>

              <p class="mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                In the macro bull run of 2021, he co-founded Meta Blocks, an
                upgradable NFT protocol on Solana. Meta Blocks grew to 8k+
                members and was valued at $10M. Although the project generated
                predictable revenue, it was not suitable for the high growth
                trajectory of the crypto market. He decided to <a
                  href="/blog/reflections-after-shutting-down-first-vc-backed-startup"
                  class="underline"
                  >shut down the project and return the money to the investors</a
                > in 2025.
              </p>
            </section>

            <section class="">
              <h3 class="font-bold text-xl md:text-2xl mb-6">Now</h3>

              <p class="mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                He is currently getting better at building AI systems, writing
                this blog, and preparing to start again.
              </p>
            </section>
          </section>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </BodyLayout>
</HtmlLayout>
